{"channelId":"UCXwWHspeb7o9zdRLwTicc5A","row":["Cat Rescue Mission",7900,"Cat Rescue Mission (CRM)\n\nEvery cat has a story. Some begin with fear, hunger, and loneliness. Others begin with a second chance.\n\nAt Cat Rescue Mission (CRM), we share inspiring rescue journeys of stray and abandoned cats through storytelling, subtitles, and carefully edited videos. From life-saving rescues to heartwarming recoveries, our goal is to celebrate the bond between humans and animals while encouraging compassion for cats in need.\n\nWe believe that every rescued cat deserves safety, love, and a place to call home.\n\nThank you for being part of our mission and helping us spread kindness, one cat at a time.\n\n🐾 Rescue • Care • Heal • Love\n❤️ Every Cat Deserves a Second Chance\n\n📩 For copyright or content concerns, please contact us directly.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXwWHspeb7o9zdRLwTicc5A","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXwWHspeb7o9zdRLwTicc5A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:16.439Z","channelId":"UCXwWHspeb7o9zdRLwTicc5A","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b72e99f775b280bbc8204d25c83fab651ccd108e56979f4521487e63c3ea511f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"9824c532048b8f55f88df1096f2f44b4dc1e96923fdf7571e99f7c4d8b9dc65f"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXwWHspeb7o9zdRLwTicc5A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:02:38.321Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXwWHspeb7o9zdRLwTicc5A","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":7900,"raw":"7.9K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXwWHspeb7o9zdRLwTicc5A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:16.439Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined"